IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `hia-medicare`

-- Health Insurance Act 1973, ss 3, 6, 6A, 7, 9, 10, 14, 17, 19, 20, 20A, 128C -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_health-insurance-act-1973.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Facts are from the Western Australian scenarios (workbench scenarios au/wa/cradle-to-grave-*) where they exist. Every
-- Schedule fee and fee charged below is HYPOTHETICAL: the Medicare Benefits Schedule is made by regulation and was not
-- deposited. Persons not named in a scenario are invented for the case.

